  "details": "I'm using Quest 2 with SteamLink. I got a trouble with my left hand after new update (2024.3.1 build 1490). Hand is too far away from controller position. In SteamVR and in VRChat main menu I can see controller overlay and It looks like all is alright, but left hand is too far from controller on any avatar. \n\nI tried to disable every finger tracking options, and play with IK settings - it didn't help me at all.\n\nHere is the video:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OD0fze-dRq0",
